Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:14:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 41/59] Use the playback status of VDR

Position, buffering and end of the video came from the transparent
video, which runs independently of the real playback. Use the status
reported by VDR: playPosition and PlayPositionChanged of the A/V
object, currentTime of HTML5 videos, buffering state, and the end of
the video. The early end of the transparent video is hidden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
